 data-grid-gb 01a4491 as 202610312133, re-pin DCF/DCFSHA, build module
 202610312138 (NL-007 P6)

Vendor datacentres/lanes/dc-a7-merge/out/uk_datacentre_pipeline.geojson byte for
byte from data-grid-gb 01a4491dc66ec4e6319a05a394926043b9d992f9 (M) as
data/uk_datacentre_pipeline_202610312133.geojson (226 features, 225 with
geometry); data/uk_datacentre_pipeline_202610292136.geojson stays for the live
generation. tools/offtakers/src/01-data.js:19 DCF stamp -> 202610312133 and
DCFSHA -> the new sha256 (one line). tools/offtakers/generations.json marks
202610292044 historical (2f80729) and lists 202610312138. The module is built
with node tools/offtakers/build.mjs --gen 202610312138.

